WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.553
An ordered float32 sum loses the one when it adds it to two to the twenty-fourth power. Forge preserves that order and returns four.

00:00:08.353 --> 00:00:18.024
The matrix kernel tiles rows, columns, and the reduction dimension. This seventeen by thirty-three by thirty-five case needs an edge tile on all three axes.

00:00:18.824 --> 00:00:27.821
The fused pointwise chain can beat NumPy. For the five hundred and twelve square matrix multiply, NumPy wins against Forge even with one BLAS thread.

00:00:28.621 --> 00:00:36.089
Repeating a cache-enabled request with the same shape produces a hit. Changing the length from four to nine produces a fresh cache miss.
